@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@origin = http://localhost:5173

### 首次注册返回 201；再次执行返回 409。此演示密码仅用于本机测试。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
X-App-Request: museum-web

{
  "username": "Museum_Email_01",
  "password": "1234",
  "email": "museum@example.com"
}

### 用户名过短，返回 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
X-App-Request: museum-web

{
  "username": "a",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 密码过短，返回 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
X-App-Request: museum-web

{
  "username": "another_user",
  "password": "123"
}

### 缺少必要请求头，返回 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "username": "another_user",
  "password": "1234"
}
